","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1024","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,54,75,66,57,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10225","city":"CS1072","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,54,75,66,57,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"2650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，仕官安丰太守，奉毌丘俭之命镇守合肥新城。吴太傅诸葛恪率大军伐魏时与其周旋，最终诸葛恪耻城不下，司马孚援军到来后使其撤离新城。","tc":"魏國武將，仕官安豐太守，奉毌丘儉之命鎮守合肥新城。吳太傅諸葛恪率大軍伐魏時與其周旋，最終諸葛恪恥城不下，司馬孚援軍到來后使其撤離新城。","en":"An officer of Wei who served as Governor of Anfeng and was ordered by Guanqiu Jian to defend the new fortress at Hefei. When the Wu Grand Tutor Zhuge Ke led a massive army to invade Wei, he skillfully maneuvered against the Wu forces. Zhuge Ke was humiliated by his failure to take the fortress, and when Sima Fu's relief army arrived, the Wu forces withdrew from the new city.","jp":"魏の武将。安豊太守に仕官し、毌丘倹の命を受けて合肥新城を守備した。呉の太傅である諸葛恪が大軍を率いて魏を討伐した際に対峙し、最終的に城を攻め落とせないことを恥じた諸葛恪は、司馬孚の援軍が到来したことで新城から撤退した。","kr":"위나라의 무장으로, 안풍태수로 사관하여 관구검의 명을 받아 합비신성을 지켰다. 오나라 태부 제갈각이 대군을 이끌고 위나라를 정벌하러 왔을 때 그와 맞서 싸웠으며, 결국 제갈각은 성을 함락하지 못한 것을 부끄럽게 여겼고, 사마부의 원군이 당도하자 신성에서 퇴각시켰다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10688","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"特","nameTc":"特","nameEn":"Te","nameJp":"特","nameKr":"특","nameOther":"","word":"子产","wordTc":"子產","wordEn":"Zichan","wordJp":"子産","wordK